				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1140,
				10
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Add dual-layer DebugServer for extension-host inspection\n\nIntroduce `Source/Debug/Server.ts` to provide a Node.js HTTP debug interface specifically for the Cocoon extension host. This mirrors the Mountain Rust `DebugServer` protocol, allowing external tools to introspect the Extension Host (EH) layer via endpoints like `/execute`, `/commands`, and `/extensions`.\n\nThe server is controlled by the unified `DebugServer` environment variable, supporting modes for `mountain`, `cocoon`, `both`, or `off`. It binds exclusively to `127.0.0.1:9934` and is gated behind a runtime check in `Main.ts` to prevent overhead in production builds.\n\nAdditionally, standardize whitespace and import ordering across the entire ESBuild configuration suite (`Configuration/ESBuild/` and `Configuration/Mountain/Config.js`) to enforce 2-space indentation and linearized export statements, aligning build artifacts with the project's strict PascalCase formatting standards.",
			"SHA": "62cd08adf3401e6e2826b7c8f6a198556f9d5e1d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-19T00:58:48Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1138,
				39
			],
			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Standardize ESBuild configuration whitespace and regenerate artifacts\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files (`Configuration/ESBuild/`, `Source/ESBuild.js`) to use 2-space indentation and linearized import/export statements. This aligns the build configuration with the project's strict PascalCase and formatting standards, replacing previous mixed-indentation styles.\n\nRebuild all `Target/` compilation artifacts to synchronize the bundles with the updated configuration. The regeneration updates the `RouteManifest` timestamp to 2026-05-19T00:43:45Z and registers two new Mountain-side RPC methods (`$scm:openDiff` and `vscode.diff`), bringing the total known RPC handlers to 120. All generated JavaScript bundles, source maps, and the `tsbuildinfo` cache are refreshed to ensure build consistency.",
			"SHA": "3467e6238787231a941947ed4400b54e4e405745"
		}
	],
